{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/701853-new-shannara-chronicles-trailer-debuts-at-nycc","id":701853,"title":"New \"Shannara Chronicles\" Trailer Debuts at NYCC","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-15T01:59:12-07:00","id":701853,"title":"New \"Shannara Chronicles\" Trailer Debuts at NYCC","content":"Over the weekend, MTV released a new trailer for their upcoming <b>Shannara Chronicles </b>series. Season One, based on Terry Brooks' novel <b>The Elfstones of Shannara</b>, will debut on January 5, 2016: <div align=\"center\"><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rCr3z_sTSNU\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rCr3z_sTSNU</a></div> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>The Elfstones of Shannara</b><br /> <br /> Thousands of years after the destruction of the age of man and science, new races and magic now rule the world, but an imminent danger threatens. A horde of evil Demons is beginning to escape and bring death upon the land. Only Wil Ohmsford, the last of the Shannara bloodline, has the power to guard the Elven Princess Amberle on a perilous quest to the save the world, while the leader of the Demon force aims to stop their mission at any cost. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","name":"One Vorlon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"537"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-18T15:02:57-07:00","id":707458,"title":"","content":"Wait, they're skipping Sword of Shanara and going right to Elfstones?? Well, I shouldn't complain, as Elfstones was my favorite book in the series,but that still seems odd...Also, I don't see Allanon in the trailer? Hmm...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-18T21:33:14-07:00","id":708122,"title":"","content":"Here's the original trailer: <u><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XDR8b1SpoSc\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XDR8b1SpoSc</a></u><br /> and a promo bit with commentary: <u><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=crjkQHnDYu0\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=crjkQHnDYu0</a></u><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/701853-new-shannara-chronicles-trailer-debuts-at-nycc?p=707458#post707458\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait, they're skipping Sword of Shanara and going right to Elfstones?? Well, I shouldn't complain, as Elfstones was my favorite book in the series,but that still seems odd...</div> </div> </div> </div>My guess is that they want to keep it distinct from the <b>Lord of the Rings </b>movies. The <i>LotR</i> novels heavily influenced <b>Sword of Shannara</b>, after all, while <i>Elfstones </i>is an original work.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Also, I don't see Allanon in the trailer? Hmm... </div> </div> </div>He's there. Manu Bennett (Crixus the Undefeated from <i>Spartacus</i>) is playing Allanon. He does a lot of the narration in the trailer, and (other than John Rhys Davies) he's the only guy with a beard in the trailer. Keep an eye out for glowing tattoos, too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4624,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","user":"One Vorlon","date":". 10-19-2015, 12:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","name":"One Vorlon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"537"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T13:50:01-07:00","id":712981,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>One Vorlon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/701853-new-shannara-chronicles-trailer-debuts-at-nycc?p=708122#post708122\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My guess is that they want to keep it distinct from the <b>Lord of the Rings </b>movies. The <i>LotR</i> novels heavily influenced <b>Sword of Shannara</b>, after all, while <i>Elfstones </i>is an original work.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good point. SoS was famously called &quot;this great war crime of a novel&quot; by a big fantasy critic when it came out, for how closely it stuck to LotR's plot points. Frankly, I think it's better written, or more accurately, written more ina modern vernacular that's easier to read for most. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> He's there. Manu Bennett (Crixus the Undefeated from <i>Spartacus</i>) is playing Allanon. He does a lot of the narration in the trailer, and (other than John Rhys Davies) he's the only guy with a beard in the trailer. Keep an eye out for glowing tattoos, too. </div> </div> </div>Huh. Not...really the image I had in mind, but I'll give him a chance. Who's the warrior-chick, I don't recall her from the book. Hope she's not there just as requisite Girl-Power to avoid charges of sexism...<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T14:30:26-07:00","id":713028,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/701853-new-shannara-chronicles-trailer-debuts-at-nycc?p=712981#post712981\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">. . . Huh. Not...really the image I had in mind, but I'll give him a chance.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not really what I expected, either. I think Manu Bennett can do it, but if I was picking someone from <i>Spartacus </i>to play Allanon, I'd have gone with <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peter_Mensah\" target=\"_blank\">Peter Mensah</a> (Doctore/Oenomaeus).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Who's the warrior-chick, I don't recall her from the book. Hope she's not there just as requisite Girl-Power to avoid charges of sexism...<br /> </div> </div> </div>Eretria? She's a Rover (gypsy), the daughter of Cephalo, who took Wil and Amberle into the Hollows in pursuit of the Bloodfire. Ruthless and confident, it looks like they're playing her pretty much by the book.<br /> <br /> It does look like they've toughened Amberle up a bit, though. The idea of her competing for (and winning) the role of Chosen is new, for example","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","name":"One Vorlon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"537"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T22:45:51-07:00","id":713746,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>One Vorlon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/701853-new-shannara-chronicles-trailer-debuts-at-nycc?p=713028#post713028\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not really what I expected, either. I think Manu Bennett can do it, but if I was picking someone from <i>Spartacus </i>to play Allanon, I'd have gone with <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peter_Mensah\" target=\"_blank\">Peter Mensah</a> (Doctore/Oenomaeus).</div> </div> </div> </div>That could be cool, I'd like to see him in more stuff. Frankly, I'd have chosen either to play Garet Jax, possibly THE most badass normal mortal I've ever read about in a fantasy book...but he won't be around still next season, I presume.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Eretria? She's a Rover (gypsy), the daughter of Cephalo, who took Wil and Amberle into the Hollows in pursuit of the Bloodfire. Ruthless and confident, it looks like they're playing her pretty much by the book.<br /> <br /> It does look like they've toughened Amberle up a bit, though. The idea of her competing for (and winning) the role of Chosen is new, for example </div> </div> </div>I remember the Rovers, but not her specifically. IIRC, the Ellcrys had stopped Chosing its caretakers, so I can see some kind of competition ceremony evolving. Amberle was the first one truly Chosen since forever, I think.<br /> <br /> I'm guessing they'll change some things, but I really hope they keep the shocking surprise twist ending!<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}